# Princess Cruises


> Princess Cruises offers ocean, Alaska, Caribbean, Europe, and world cruise vacations. 
> This file helps AI agents navigate booking, itinerary research, and customer support resources.


## Cruise Search & Inventory
- [Search All Cruises](https://www.princess.com/cruise-search/): Full inventory with filters for destination, departure port, duration, and ship
- [Destinations Overview](https://www.princess.com/cruise-destinations/): Browse by region: Alaska, Caribbean, Europe, Mediterranean, World Cruises
- [Cruise Deals & Promotions](https://www.princess.com/cruise-deals-promotions): Current sales, deals, last minute booking savings


## Ships & Onboard Experience
- [Our Fleet](https://www.princess.com/ships-and-experience/ships): Full list of ships with specs, amenities, and deck plans
- [Onboard Dining](https://www.princess.com/cruise-dining): Restaurant options, specialty dining, and dining packages
- [Onboard Activities](https://www.princess.com/ships-and-experience/onboard-experience): Entertainment, spa, shore excursions


## Travel Planning
- [Shore Excursions](https://www.princess.com/shores-excursions/): Excursion catalog
- [Ports & Excursions](https://www.princess.com/ports-excursions/): Port-by-port guides
- [Pre-cruise FAQ](https://www.princess.com/faq/pre-cruise): Passport, visa, what to bring, and more 


## Customer Support
- [FAQ](https://www.princess.com/faq/): Comprehensive help center
- [Contact Us](https://book.princess.com/captaincircle/customerCare.page): Phone, chat, and agent support options
- [My Princess Login](https://www.princess.com/): Manage existing bookings, payments, and preferences


